# TypeScript Snippets 📘

My personal collection of TypeScript code snippets, utility functions, and interesting patterns I've learned. 

## 🎯 Goal
The purpose of this repository is to document my learning journey and keep a handy reference of useful TypeScript features (like generics, advanced types, etc.).

## 📂 Structure
- `/basics` - Core TypeScript concepts
- `/advanced-types` - Utility types, generics, mapped types
- `/functions` - Interesting function implementations


